WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.834
♪ Classical Music ♪

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:05.046
Mitch Kessler my co-host and partner of
fifteen years,

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.841
was fired today for sexual misconduct.

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:09.509
(screaming)

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.303
Corey: I've only been running the news
division for a month, but...

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:14.723
This is a good time to start grooming
some new people.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:19.519
Chip, You are the EP. The show is slipping
on your watch.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:23.815
The only thing keeping us afloat,
is me.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:26.776
We are doing this my way.

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:31.406
My new Morning Show cohost is
Bradley Jackson.

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:35.618
I think most people wanna trust the person
telling them about the world,

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:36.931
is an honest person.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.582
- Like you.
- Yes.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.251
- Chip. I wanna produce her.
- Why?

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:47.756
We are in the middle of an epic rebirth.
It's kind of exciting.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:48.923
Glad you're excited.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:50.842
Did you know about Mitch?

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.220
We have someone who could corroborate
network complicity.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.765
You have evidence against the head of this
company.

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:58.683
- Five, four...
- Corey: Stay...

00:00:58.683 --> 00:00:59.893
- Julia: Three
- Corey: and fight.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.478
Julia: Two.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:03.313
- Are we doing this?
- Yeah.

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:06.649
We would like to share some information
about our network.

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:09.110
Bradley: Corporate culture comes from the
top down.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.237
We cannot accept a culture of silence.

00:01:12.363 --> 00:01:14.783
- Oh gosh.
- We have to stay together on this.

00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:15.700
Okay.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.785
(overlapping chatter)

00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:20.080
(sustained beeping sound)

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:24.250
Corey. He asked me to look after you, but
I don't think you need it.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.587
My brother is having a really hard time.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.673
- You need to go now.
- Don't touch... No. No!

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:35.136
I'm on your side always.
I love you.

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.471
♪

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:38.431
Maggie Brenner's book is coming out.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.559
There's going to be some damning
information in there. I'm done.

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:45.355
You do hold the network accountable.
Why rope Alex into it?

00:01:45.355 --> 00:01:48.191
We risked our careers just to get the
truth out there.

00:01:48.191 --> 00:01:49.275
(gasps)

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.278
Stella: Alex, you earned a connection to
the women of this country.

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.613
I'm here as a result.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:56.699
You opened a door and you need to walk
through it now.

00:01:57.575 --> 00:02:01.121
Fred is planting nasty stories in the
press. We can stop them.

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:04.749
The only thing that moves the needle is an
even more salacious story.

00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:08.503
Kyle: You know who's dating Laura
Peterson and Bradley Jackson?

00:02:09.087 --> 00:02:10.630
Al: I'm gonna need proof.

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.216
Bradley: I don't want my private life
public.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:17.345
I need you to release a statement. You and
me never happened.

00:02:17.345 --> 00:02:19.347
(music intensifies)

00:02:19.347 --> 00:02:20.849
Mia. You should look at this.

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:22.517
♪

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:25.353
Mitch Kessler has tragically died.

00:02:25.353 --> 00:02:27.147
(music continues to intensify)

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.941
I was only put in charge after failure was
certain.

00:02:29.941 --> 00:02:32.944
- I'm trying to help.
- Then don't undermine my authority.

00:02:32.944 --> 00:02:35.029
I tested positive for Covid.

00:02:35.029 --> 00:02:36.739
I'm barely hanging on right now.

00:02:37.532 --> 00:02:38.867
The network wants you on the air.

00:02:39.367 --> 00:02:42.912
What could be more informative than
watching Alex get through it.

00:02:42.912 --> 00:02:44.247
What if she doesn't get through it?

00:02:44.247 --> 00:02:45.331
♪

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:48.751
You really think this is about your
television network?

00:02:48.751 --> 00:02:52.630
This is a battle for the soul of the
universe!

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:54.966
♪

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:56.342
Stay tuned.

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:57.510
♪

